+    "name":"Primary Team rotation",
+    "parent_account_id":"PARENT_ACCOUNT_ID",
+    "max_members":10
+  }' | jq
+```
+
+启动一个真实循环；默认额度剩余 `1%` 时轮换，失败最多重试 5 次。先审阅流程时把 `shadow_mode` 改为 `true`：
